# AWS CCP — Integration, Analytics & AI

Which service provides message queues that decouple application components?
---
SQS
= Amazon SQS
= Simple Queue Service
---
Producers drop messages, consumers pull them when ready. Nothing is lost if a consumer is down.

Which pub/sub service pushes one message out to many subscribers such as email, SMS, and other services?
---
SNS
= Amazon SNS
= Simple Notification Service
---
SNS pushes, SQS is pulled. Fanning SNS into SQS queues is a classic pattern.

Which serverless event bus routes events between AWS services and SaaS applications?
---
EventBridge
= Amazon EventBridge
---
Rules match events and route them to targets. It grew out of CloudWatch Events.

Which service coordinates multi-step serverless workflows as visual state machines?
---
Step Functions
= AWS Step Functions
---
Retries, branching, and human-approval waits between Lambda calls, without glue code.

Which service runs standard SQL queries directly against data sitting in S3?
---
Athena
= Amazon Athena
---
Serverless, pay per query. A favorite exam answer for one-off log analysis.

Which service builds BI dashboards and visualizations from your data?
---
QuickSight
= Amazon QuickSight
---
The AWS answer to Tableau and Power BI.

Which serverless service discovers, catalogs, and transforms data for analytics?
---
Glue
= AWS Glue
---
ETL: extract, transform, load. Its Data Catalog feeds Athena and Redshift.

Which service collects and processes real-time streaming data such as clickstreams?
---
Kinesis
= Amazon Kinesis
---
Real time is the keyword. Firehose is the flavor that just delivers streams into S3 or Redshift.

Which service runs big data frameworks like Apache Spark and Hadoop on managed clusters?
---
EMR
= Amazon EMR
= Elastic MapReduce
---
Heavy-duty processing over massive datasets.

Which service lets developers build, train, and deploy machine learning models?
---
SageMaker
= Amazon SageMaker
---
The full ML workbench. The ready-made AI services below need no ML expertise at all.

Which service provides API access to generative AI foundation models?
---
Bedrock
= Amazon Bedrock
---
Models from Anthropic, Amazon, Meta, and others behind one serverless API.

Which AI service identifies objects, faces, and text in images and video?
---
Rekognition
= Amazon Rekognition
---
Content moderation and celebrity detection included.

Which AI service turns text into lifelike speech?
---
Polly
= Amazon Polly
---
Named for a parrot. Transcribe is the reverse direction.

Which AI service converts recorded speech into text?
---
Transcribe
= Amazon Transcribe
---
Subtitles and call-center transcripts. Translate handles languages, Comprehend the meaning.

Which AI service finds sentiment, entities, and key phrases in text?
---
Comprehend
= Amazon Comprehend
---
Natural language processing as an API. Point it at reviews or support tickets.

Which AI service builds conversational chatbots with voice and text?
---
Lex
= Amazon Lex
---
The technology behind Alexa, minus the speaker.

Which AI service extracts text, tables, and form fields from scanned documents?
---
Textract
= Amazon Textract
---
Beyond OCR: it understands structure like key-value pairs on a form.

Which service runs a full cloud-based contact center?
---
Connect
= Amazon Connect
---
Phone tree to agent desktop, priced per use.
